15. Instruction: Write a JavaScript function to calculate the factorial of a given number
15. Input: <none>
15. Output: <function>
15. Explanation: The factorial of a number can be calculated using a recursive function in JavaScript as follows:
```javascript
function factorial(x) {
  if (x === 0 || x === 1) {
    return 1;
  } else {
    return x * factorial(x-1);
  }
}
``` 
